==========================================================

# Approval Log

Seluruh approval wajib mencatat:

Document

Approver

Decision

Date Time

Comment

IP Address

Device

==========================================================

# Approval Notification

Approval menghasilkan:

In App Notification

Email

WhatsApp

Webhook

==========================================================

# AI Recommendation

AI dapat memberikan:

Rekomendasi Approve

Rekomendasi Reject

Analisis Risiko

Namun keputusan akhir
tetap dilakukan sesuai
aturan bisnis dan hak akses.

==========================================================

# Business Rules

Approval tidak boleh dilewati.

Approval tidak boleh diubah
setelah dokumen selesai.

Approval wajib masuk Audit Log.

Approval wajib masuk Activity Log.

==========================================================

# Success Criteria

Approval dapat dikonfigurasi.

Approval mendukung
single,
multi,
parallel,
conditional,
dan delegation.

Approval dapat diaudit.

